<section class="shell band">
  <h1>EMDR consultation</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Reem Glasco is an EMDRIA Approved Consultant, certified in EMDR and trained in the
    ASSYST-I, PRECI and IGTP-OTS protocols. Individual consultation is <strong>$185</strong> an
    hour, online, and starts with a free consult to check fit. The emphasis is IFS-informed
    EMDR for phases one and two, with Somatic Experiencing, Brainspotting and NARM interweaves
    where they help.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="cta" href="/contact/">Schedule a free consult</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--sand">
  <div class="shell split">
    <div>
      <h2>What we work on</h2>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>Preparation and stabilisation that actually holds, so phase four does not collapse
        back into overwhelm.</li>
        <li>IFS-informed EMDR for phases one and two, particularly with clients who have parts
        that object to the work.</li>
        <li>Titration and pacing for clients with developmental trauma, where standard protocol
        timing is too fast.</li>
        <li>Interweaves drawn from Somatic Experiencing, NARM and Brainspotting, and knowing
        when not to reach for one.</li>
        <li>Acute and ongoing stress protocols, including ASSYST and group protocols.</li>
        <li>Transference and countertransference as clinical information, with your own nervous
        system treated as part of the data.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
